{"id":"wb-6-672","name":"桃花源古建筑群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"桃花源 (湖南)","text":"桃花源位于中华人民共和国湖南省常德市桃源县，面临沅水，背依群山。桃花源主体景区15.8平方公里，包括桃花山、桃源山、秦人村和桃仙岭四片。\n此地被认为是陶渊明名作《桃花源记》的原型，桃花源古建筑群是国家重点文物保护单位，保护范围包括桃花山牌坊、渊明祠、方竹亭、桃花观、遇仙桥、集贤祠、佳致碑、问津亭、高举阁、水源亭、临仙馆、白云轩等十数处。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%A1%83%E8%8A%B1%E6%BA%90_(%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97)","revisionId":95223512,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95223512","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/def2266e9780204e8e561e26.jpg","title":"The_peach_garden_1.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_peach_garden_1.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/71/The_peach_garden_1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Huangdan2060","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":"","caption":"​桃花源，位于湖南省常德市桃源县，一个美丽的、众所周知的旅游胜地。","width":320,"height":240}}